    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/0e4e51bcb290fe68052cbc99a552a88d.webp?t=1743889472\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/18081158c2993be8113a160efa56ed1c.webp?t=1743889472\" width=600 height=47 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/2bec26044a2de3d7fe555587bf88b468.poster.avif?t=1743889472\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/2bec26044a2de3d7fe555587bf88b468.webm?t=1743889472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/2bec26044a2de3d7fe555587bf88b468.mp4?t=1743889472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, you want to play a game? Do I really have a choice? A card game? Interesting. And who is this chick on the cards? She looks like a thief in a manor, doesn't she? Okay, so what do I do? Whoa, whoa, whoa! Why are you pulling that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What the HELL is this? A BOARD? Okay, tell me the rules, you b****!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/7d2841d7ade0176736033cbf0f21bac8.poster.avif?t=1743889472\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/7d2841d7ade0176736033cbf0f21bac8.webm?t=1743889472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/7d2841d7ade0176736033cbf0f21bac8.mp4?t=1743889472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck</strong> and uncover the story of the thief girl as she:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 delves deeper into the manor,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 steals valuable items,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 evades the killers' attacks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 heals herself to survive longer, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 and (hopefully) escapes alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And if you master the card battle against the Madam, you will also get out alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/25ef78deecd49f85bf2bcfeaa6617aeb.avif?t=1743889472\" width=600 height=94 /></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/0e4e51bcb290fe68052cbc99a552a88d.webp?t=1743889472\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/18081158c2993be8113a160efa56ed1c.webp?t=1743889472\" width=600 height=47 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/2bec26044a2de3d7fe555587bf88b468.poster.avif?t=1743889472\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/2bec26044a2de3d7fe555587bf88b468.webm?t=1743889472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/2bec26044a2de3d7fe555587bf88b468.mp4?t=1743889472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, you want to play a game? Do I really have a choice? A card game? Interesting. And who is this chick on the cards? She looks like a thief in a manor, doesn't she? Okay, so what do I do? Whoa, whoa, whoa! Why are you pulling that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What the HELL is this? A BOARD? Okay, tell me the rules, you b****!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/7d2841d7ade0176736033cbf0f21bac8.poster.avif?t=1743889472\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/7d2841d7ade0176736033cbf0f21bac8.webm?t=1743889472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/7d2841d7ade0176736033cbf0f21bac8.mp4?t=1743889472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your deck</strong> and uncover the story of the thief girl as she:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 delves deeper into the manor,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 steals valuable items,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 evades the killers' attacks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 heals herself to survive longer, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 and (hopefully) escapes alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And if you master the card battle against the Madam, you will also get out alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963160/extras/25ef78deecd49f85bf2bcfeaa6617aeb.avif?t=1743889472\" width=600 height=94 /></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>",
